1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,902
Har client aate hi kehta hai:

2
00:00:01,922 --> 00:00:03,300
"Mujhe ek app chahiye."

3
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,890
Zyadatar ko nahi chahiye.

4
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:07,317
Unhe chahiye ek spreadsheet jo khud update

5
00:00:07,337 --> 00:00:07,820
ho jaaye.

6
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:09,408
Teen sawaal se pata chalega.

7
00:00:09,469 --> 00:00:12,013
Teesra wahi hai jahan budget dam tod

8
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:12,850
deta hai.

9
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,271
Ek: ise use kaun karega?

10
00:00:15,291 --> 00:00:17,168
Customers? Shayad app.

11
00:00:17,188 --> 00:00:18,417
Sirf aapki team?

12
00:00:18,446 --> 00:00:20,403
To aapko internal tool chahiye,

13
00:00:20,423 --> 00:00:22,010
App Store listing nahi.

14
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,430
Do: kya wahi kaam roz hota hai?

15
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:26,186
Orders copy karna,

16
00:00:26,206 --> 00:00:27,429
reports nikalna,

17
00:00:27,449 --> 00:00:28,539
stock update karna.

18
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:30,027
Agar repeat hota hai,

19
00:00:30,047 --> 00:00:31,300
to automate karo.

20
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:33,856
Teen: kya aap poora system ek page

21
00:00:33,876 --> 00:00:35,169
pe draw kar sakte ho?

22
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:35,789
Agar nahi,

23
00:00:35,809 --> 00:00:37,284
to abhi build mat karo.

24
00:00:37,304 --> 00:00:39,447
Yahi step log skip karte hain,

25
00:00:39,467 --> 00:00:41,610
aur yahin budget explode hota hai.

26
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,678
Hum har project ko pehle ek page

27
00:00:43,698 --> 00:00:45,159
pe scope karte hain,

28
00:00:45,179 --> 00:00:46,919
code ki ek line likhne se bhi

29
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:48,699
pehle. SCOPE comment karo,

30
00:00:48,719 --> 00:00:51,030
aur main aapko apni checklist bhej dunga.
